OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous levels' of noise on
OL,4,Asome Tube lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondoners on three major Tube lines are
OL,7,Fexperiencing "dangerous levels" of
OL,8,Fnoise while on the Underground network,
OL,9,Fdata suggests.
OL,11,FPassengers on the Victoria, Northern
OL,12,Fand Jubilee lines face a "tunnel
OL,13,Fscreech" at levels of more than 100
OL,14,Fdecibels (dB) - louder than a nearby
OL,15,Fchainsaw or power tool.
OL,17,FExposure to such sound intensity can
OL,18,Fcause hearing damage, as well as
OL,19,Fdisturbing residents above ground.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
