OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous levels' of noise on
OL,4,Asome Tube lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the data, revealed by
OL,7,FTransport for London (TfL) and the
OL,8,Fmayor of London's office, the network
OL,9,Freceived 707 noise complaints over the
OL,10,Fpast three years.
